# Normalise line endings so prettier --check and CI agree regardless of the
# developer's OS. Text files are stored with LF in the repo and checked out with
# LF everywhere; without this, Windows checkouts get CRLF and `format:check`
# (prettier endOfLine: lf) fails on an otherwise-clean tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending-normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
